    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "kizuna_ecology_a_03a",
      "hash64": "ADA252915EEB8A25",
      "text": "Tant mieux ! Tu as l’air de passer du bon temps.\\nJ’en suis ravi ![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
